{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t美國堪薩斯州有汽車衝入一個足球比賽現場，造成兩人死亡，包括一名六歲男童，另有十人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，事發在當地周末下午，一名34歲女司機駕駛肇事車輛，她已被拘留。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n死者包括六歲男孩和35歲男子，有傷者傷勢嚴重，形容這是一場悲劇。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:18:46.633624+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:41:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T15:18:00.548609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:17:34.715506+00:00","content_hash":"234337391d279cd547a3e9bdea2eb1bc249b74b4e0c51fba0d0f73e6a05ba18d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}